Your choices and rights
You can ask us to:

tell you what personal information we hold about you and give you a copy;
correct information that’s wrong;
delete your raw records before the 30 days are up;
stop using your information for a particular purpose.

Email prompthumanhq@gmail.com from the address you used with us, or include your request ID so we can confirm the request is yours. We’ll respond within 30 days. We may need to keep payment records the law requires us to keep. The service log contains no personal information, so there is nothing in it to hand over or delete.
